    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"let the rest of you finally catch up to that reality and just rest\"... that sounds almost peaceful. like, if there's nothing left to do, why keep struggling against it? everyone's going to see me as a failure anyway. it feels like the only way to actually stop this feeling of being a ghost is to just... stop everything. how is there any dignity in just dragging myself through a life that doesn't even belong to me anymore?",
